                                                    .findFirst();
                                }

                                if (optionalTaskModel.isEmpty()) {
                                    LOGGER.error(
                                            "No matching tasks found to be marked as completed for workflow {}, taskRefName {}, taskId {}",
                                            workflowId,
                                            taskRefName,
                                            taskId);
